<view class="page report-page"><view class="report-head"><text class="eyebrow">A SMALL REPORT, A BETTER CITY</text><text class="report-title">{{profile.icon}} {{profile.name}}<text>问题上报</text></text><text class="report-copy">将由{{profile.department}}接收处理。</text></view><view class="category-note">{{profile.hint}}</view><view class="form card"><text class="form-label">这是什么问题？</text><view class="type-wrap"><text wx:for="{{profile.types}}" wx:key="*this" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose" class="type {{selected === item ? 'selected' : ''}}">{{item}}</text></view><text class="form-label form-gap">添加现场图片</text><view class="upload"><view class="plus">＋</view><text>拍照或从相册选择</text><text>最多上传 3 张</text></view><text class="form-label form-gap">补充说明</text><view class="fake-input">{{profile.placeholder}}<text>0 / 200</text></view><text class="form-label form-gap">发生地点</text><view class="place"><text>⌖</text><view><text>选择问题地点</text><text>杭州市西湖区 · 附近</text></view><text>›</text></view></view><view class="privacy">✓ 我们会严格保护你的个人信息</view><view class="submit" bindtap="submit"><text>提交{{profile.name}}问题</text><text>→</text></view></view>
